    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manase na Efulaimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza ilebe ū Yosefu ūwīlwa gīkī, “Ū so alīsaata.” Na lūūlū ūbasola a bitūnja bakwe a ba Manase nū Efulaimu, ūja nabo koi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo aho wawīlwa gīkī, “Ū ng'witūnja wako ū Yosefu wiza kūkūlola;” ū Isilaeli wiyūmīlīja kūgūngūmūka, wigasha a ha būlīīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūng'wīla gīkī, “Aho nalī Luzu, mu sī ya Kanaani, ū Mulungu wa būdūla bose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mulungu wa būdūla bose:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiohebulania, Eli Shadai.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " akaniilongela, ūnifuuha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla gīkī, ‘Nakūkwīta ūbize na mbyala nhaale, na a banhū bako nakūbakwīja. Nakūkwīta ūbize ihanga lya banhū bingī. Nī sī yenīyī nakūkwinha bebe na banhū ba shibyalīlwe shako, ībize yako ya wikomangīle kūshisha welelo bose.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, a bitūnja bako a babīlī abo ūkabyalīlwa mu Misili nataalī ū nene kwiza kūūnū, babizaga bane; ū Efulaimu nū Manase bane, gīt'umo Lubeni na Simioni balī bane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a baana bose bose abo ūlabyalīlwe a ha numa ya benaba, bene bako. Ū mu sī īyo balinhwe bakūbalīlwa ū mu mina ga baana ba ng'wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Laheli akazumalīkīla mu sī ya Kanaani tūlī mu nzīla nalīshoka kūfuma Padani. Tūūsangwa twegeela dūhū ī Efulata, nūnjīka bbihī n'ikūūwa lya Efulata (h'ī Betelehemu), ūnilekela būpīna.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isilaeli aho wababona a bitūnja ba ng'wa Yosefu a babīlī, ūbūja; “Banani a beneba?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūng'wīla ū ise gīkī, “Angū h'a bitūnja bane abo Mulungu waninha ū mu sī īyī.” Hūna ū Isilaeli ūhaya, “Benhage aha nabafuuhe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a miso ga ng'wa Isilaeli gakasangwa gandije kwīta wiija kūlwa nguno ya būkūji; nose walī atabonaga chiza. Na lūūlū ū Yosefu ūbeegeleja a bitūnja bakwe a halī ise; nang'hwe ū ise ūbakumbatīla na kūbabbipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isilaeli ūng'wīla ū Yosefu gīkī, “Ī liganiko lya kūbūbona ū būshū wako lyalī lyashila, alīyo ī haha ū Mulungu wanizunīlīgije kūbabona na a baana bako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūbīnja a ha mazwi ga ng'wa ise, hanuma winama ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa ise, ū kūnū achimīgije ha sī ū būshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ū Yosefu ūbasola ūbabūcha būbīlī wabo, ū Efulaimu mu nkono gwakwe gwa būlyo ūnoleja kū nkono gwa lūmoso gwa ng'wa Isilaeli, ū Manase mu nkono gwakwe gwa lūmoso, ūnoleja kū nkono gwa būlyo gwa ng'wa Isilaeli; hūna ūbeegeleja a halī we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isilaeli ūgabisanya a makono gakwe; ūgūgoloola ū nkono gwakwe ū gwa būlyo, ūgūtūūla ha ntwe gwa ng'wa Efulaimu, nūūlū īkī walī ndo. Ū gwa lūmoso ūgūtūūla ha ntwe gwa ng'wa Manase, nūūlū īkī ū Manase hū walī tangī ū kūbyalwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu aho wamona ū ise watūūla ū nkono gwakwe ū gwa būlyo ha ntwe gwa ng'wa Efulaimu, akaleka ū kūyega; na lūūlū ūgwīnja ū nkono gwa ng'wa ise a ha ntwe gwa ng'wa Efulaimu ūgūtūūla ha ntwe gwa ng'wa Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūng'wīla ū ise, “Baba wahūbīla, ūyū hū myalwa wa kwandya, ntūūlīlage ng'wene ū nkono gwako ū gwa būlyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ise akalema ūhaya, “Namanile ng'wanone, nilekage namanile. Nang'hwe akūbiza ihanga lya banhū; nīyo nū wei akūbiza ntaale. Alīyo ū nzunaye akūbiza ntaale kūntinda ū wei, nīyo ū būbyīle wakwe būkūbiza mahanga mingī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
